# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# The crossing's colours.  Four of them are the board itself and the
# rest are what moves on it; the board's four are the ones to get
# right, because water that does not read as water is a game about a
# frog hopping into a blue rectangle.  Shades between them - ripples,
# grain, windows, a sinking turtle - are derived from these rather
# than stored, so there is nothing here that can disagree with itself.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

