config PACMAN_DASHBOARD_STYLE
    string "Dashboard style"
    default "classic"
    help
      "classic" is the configurable slot grid with the animated Pac-Man header.
      "arcade" is the fixed cabinet-HUD layout: the same six readouts drawn as
      an arcade machine's own HUD - WPM as the 1UP score, the layer as the
      STAGE, the profile as the CREDIT count, connectivity as player lamps,
      modifiers as lit buttons, the batteries as ENERGY bars.

